  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02. 跨年坦白局：那些我所痛苦的和所成长的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6795dc65247d51713c5b0932</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6795dc65247d51713c5b0932</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jan 2025 07:08:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>进入2025年的伊始，临近春节，伴随一种全民的仪式，让跨年好像真的要不断的有“跨”这个动作，年才能过去。于是我邀请身边几位独立女性，共同来一场我们视角的坦白局，坦诚对待自己，去梳理我们在时间的跌跌撞撞中获得的新生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Show notes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 按时睡觉这件事好像总是很难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 睡眠EBP疗法对我的改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 想要精神好，要懂得有紧有松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> 过去一年的三个重要瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> 第一次删除一个好友时，我学会了人际筛选这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 在伤害来临时，我却更不怕付出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> “大包大揽”的付出后，需警惕对方的“理所当然”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a> 熟悉滋生轻谩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> 父母向我们扔“刀子”时，说还是不说，吵还是不吵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a> 面对“原生家庭”，改变可改变的，接纳不可改变的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 做好理财，从管理好信用卡开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2808">46:48</a> 对2025年许个愿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2877">47:57</a> 搞钱到底是为了温饱还是无节制的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3126">52:06</a> 祝愿大家找到补给能量的磁场、珍惜当下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3241">54:01</a> 我如何理解“意义感”之于人的价值</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>生活不规律的#媛媛</span></p><span></span><p><span>对自己特别狠的#双双</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主持人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一喝酒就上头的#阿拉叮</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>封面图来源：阿拉叮摄影</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/622bfe00187afb035496ad9e/lh8YLve-aNarkdH2N83dcn9JiihR.m4a" length="55840248" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKRDwsu2eP_7sClmrkmfGGuIofs.png"/>
